WEBVTT

00:02.991 --> 00:05.887
<i>[mellow music]</i>
<i>[柔和的音乐]</i>

00:05.956 --> 00:11.128
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:11.197 --> 00:16.232
One large Flotsam fries,
extra Jetsam,
一大块漂浮薯条，
额外的Jetsam，

00:16.301 --> 00:18.370
four orders of duckweed.
四份浮萍。

00:18.439 --> 00:19.508
Hmm.
唔。

00:19.577 --> 00:22.922
Methinks thou forgot my gravy,
我想你忘记了我的肉汁，

00:22.991 --> 00:26.404
thou lumpish clay-brained
flap dragon.
你这个笨蛋
拍打龙。

00:26.473 --> 00:28.301
[laughs]
Flap dragon.
[笑]
拍打龙.

00:28.370 --> 00:30.163
[giggles]
- [sighs]
[咯咯笑]
- [叹气]

00:30.232 --> 00:32.266
Oh, and finally,
哦，最后，

00:32.335 --> 00:34.646
one Deep Sea Donut.
一个深海甜甜圈。

00:34.715 --> 00:36.094
That comes to a total of...
这样一来，总共...

00:36.163 --> 00:40.404
Whatever the measure, squire,
put it on my account.
不管采取什么措施，乡绅，
把它记到我的账户上。

00:40.473 --> 00:42.611
- Oh, no, you don't.
- [gasps]
- 哦，不，你不知道。
- [喘气]

00:42.680 --> 00:46.749
No more food for you
until you pay your tab.
没有更多的食物给你
直到您付清帐单。

00:46.818 --> 00:50.887
[stammering]
Pay tab?
[结巴]
付费标签？

00:52.335 --> 00:54.301
I'll flip you for it.
我会为它翻转你。

00:54.370 --> 00:56.646
[coin jingles]
- I'll take that.
[硬币歌曲]
- 我会接受的。

00:56.715 --> 01:00.508
How about a friendly game
of Three Deadly Challenges?
来场友谊赛怎么样
三个致命的挑战？

01:00.577 --> 01:03.128
<i>[dramatic orchestral music]</i>
<i>[戏剧性管弦乐]</i>

01:03.197 --> 01:05.266
Oh, castle.
Pick castle!
哦，城堡。
选择城堡！

01:05.335 --> 01:07.266
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:07.335 --> 01:10.473
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

01:10.542 --> 01:12.439
[laughs]
I bet we'll never see
[笑]
我打赌我们永远不会看到

01:12.508 --> 01:15.025
that game geek again.
又是那个游戏极客。

01:15.094 --> 01:17.715
[bell dings] <i>- 50 Krabby Patties please.</i>
[铃声]<i>- 请给我 50 个蟹黄饼。</i>

01:17.784 --> 01:19.991
<i>Extra pickles!</i>
<i>额外的泡菜！</i>

01:20.059 --> 01:21.577
Put it on my tab.
把它放在我的标签上。

01:21.646 --> 01:23.266
Coming right up.
马上就来了。

01:23.335 --> 01:25.577
- Bubble Bass!
- [whimpers]
- 泡泡鲈鱼！
- [呜咽]

01:25.646 --> 01:28.163
- [snarls]
- [chuckles]
- [咆哮]
- [轻笑]

01:28.232 --> 01:29.749
♪ Hey, nonny-nonny ♪
♪ 嘿，老妈老妈 ♪

01:29.818 --> 01:31.404
♪ You look pretty funny ♪
♪ 你看起来很有趣 ♪

01:31.473 --> 01:34.404
♪ You won't get my money,
nah, nah-nah, nah-nah ♪
♪ 你不会得到我的钱，
不，不，不，不，不 ♪

01:34.473 --> 01:36.301
[car horn honks]
[汽车喇叭鸣响]

01:36.370 --> 01:38.473
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

01:38.542 --> 01:40.197
Mr. Squidward!
章鱼哥先生！

01:40.266 --> 01:43.439
I want you and SpongeBob
to go after Bubble Bass,
我想要你和海绵宝宝
去追泡泡鲈鱼，

01:43.508 --> 01:45.232
and collect his tab.
并收集他的标签。

01:45.301 --> 01:48.025
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

01:48.094 --> 01:50.163
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

01:50.232 --> 01:52.439
Hey, nonny-nonny,
you look pretty funny.
嘿，尼尼尼尼，
你看起来很有趣。

01:52.508 --> 01:55.197
You won't get my money. You...
- [sighs]
你不会得到我的钱。你...
- [叹气]

01:55.266 --> 01:57.197
I can't help it.
It's catchy.
我无能为力。
很吸引人。

01:57.266 --> 01:59.646
Look, I just want
to collect the money
你看，我只是想要
收钱

01:59.715 --> 02:02.025
as soon as possible and go.
尽快走吧。

02:02.094 --> 02:05.818
Bubble Bass!
We're here to collect your tab!
泡泡贝斯！
我们来收集您的标签！

02:05.887 --> 02:07.025
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:07.094 --> 02:10.508
Squidward,
that was so masculine.
章鱼哥，
那真是太有男子气概了。

02:10.577 --> 02:12.301
Uh, well, I... [clears throat]
呃，好吧，我...[清嗓子]

02:12.370 --> 02:14.404
Let's go.
我们走吧。

02:14.473 --> 02:17.301
I know you're in here.
Come out.
我知道你在这儿。
出来。

02:17.370 --> 02:20.301
[sniffs]
Smells funny in here.
[嗅嗅]
这里闻起来很奇怪。

02:21.749 --> 02:23.404
Smells like deadbeat.
闻起来像死气沉沉的人。

02:23.473 --> 02:24.611
Hmm.
唔。

02:24.680 --> 02:26.404
If you don't pay up,
如果你不还钱的话

02:26.473 --> 02:29.094
we'll sell this furniture.
我们要卖掉这件家具。

02:29.163 --> 02:30.577
- [gasps]
- Whoops.
- [喘气]
- 哎呀。

02:30.646 --> 02:31.691
How much do you think
this is worth?
你觉得多少
这值得吗？

02:31.715 --> 02:33.094
I just chipped it.
我刚刚把它切碎了。

02:33.163 --> 02:34.749
Oh, it was the chip
that sold me!
哦，原来是芯片
那卖了我！

02:34.818 --> 02:36.715
I'll give you 10 bucks.
- Hey!
我给你10块钱。
- 嘿！

02:36.784 --> 02:39.887
Don't touch mother's things.
I'll pay the tab.
不要碰妈妈的东西。
我来付帐单。

02:39.956 --> 02:42.025
Come downstairs,
and we'll work it out.
下楼来，
我们会解决这个问题的。

02:42.094 --> 02:43.680
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:43.749 --> 02:46.680
[both yelp]
[两人都尖叫]

02:46.749 --> 02:50.128
[crashing]
[崩溃]

02:50.197 --> 02:51.404
[moaning]
[呻吟]

02:51.473 --> 02:54.404
- My savior.
- Huh? Oh.
- 我的救星。
- 啊？哦。

02:54.473 --> 02:55.956
All right, where is he?
好吧，他在哪儿？

02:56.025 --> 02:57.784
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:57.853 --> 03:01.818
If you want me to pay,
you'll have to play
如果你要我付钱的话
你必须玩

03:01.887 --> 03:05.404
The Three Deadly Challenges.
三个致命的挑战。

03:05.473 --> 03:07.715
Oh!
The Three Deadly Challenges!
哦！
三大致命挑战！

03:07.784 --> 03:10.542
[excited panting]
I've got this game.
[兴奋气喘吁吁]
我有这个游戏。

03:10.611 --> 03:13.508
Where is it? Game of Strife,
Chutes and Bladders...
它在哪里？冲突游戏，
滑槽和气囊...

03:13.577 --> 03:15.439
Oh, here it is!
Ah!
哦，在这里！
啊!

03:15.508 --> 03:17.853
The Three Deadly Challenges.
<i>[dramatic orchestral music]</i>
三个致命的挑战。
<i>[戏剧性管弦乐]</i>

03:17.922 --> 03:20.784
A board game. Whoopee.
一款棋盘游戏。哎呀。

03:20.853 --> 03:24.128
Okay, Bubble Bass.
We accept the challenge.
好吧，泡泡巴斯。
我们接受挑战。

03:24.197 --> 03:26.542
Why are you giving him
the upper hand?
你为什么要给他
占上风？

03:26.611 --> 03:28.266
He owes us money!
他欠我们钱！

03:28.335 --> 03:29.715
Oh.
哦。

03:29.784 --> 03:32.991
But I wanna pway
The Thwee Deadwy Chawwenges.
但我想走
Thwee Deadwy Chawwenges。

03:33.059 --> 03:34.715
Oh, all wight... [clears throat]
噢，好吧……[清嗓子]

03:34.784 --> 03:37.301
All right already!
Let's get this over with.
已经好了！
让我们结束这一切吧。

03:37.370 --> 03:38.577
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

03:38.646 --> 03:40.715
[laughs]
[crashes]
[笑]
[崩溃]

03:40.784 --> 03:43.370
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

03:43.439 --> 03:45.059
- Wow!
- Huh?
- 哇！
- 啊？

03:45.128 --> 03:48.646
A life-size version
of the Three Deadly Challenges.
真人大小的版本
三个致命的挑战。

03:48.715 --> 03:49.887
Beautiful!
美丽的！

03:49.956 --> 03:51.715
Looks like a hobo campground.
看起来像一个流浪汉露营地。

03:51.784 --> 03:53.197
No, Squidward.
不，章鱼哥。

03:53.266 --> 03:56.784
You have to look
with your imagination.
你必须看看
凭你的想象力。

03:56.853 --> 03:59.611
What the... oh!
[speaks gibberish]
什么啊……哦！
[胡言乱语]

03:59.680 --> 04:00.956
It's a dump!
这是一个垃圾场！

04:01.025 --> 04:03.784
Thou art two oozing cysts
你是两个渗出的囊肿

04:03.853 --> 04:08.128
on the hindside
of a plague dog's nose.
在后侧
瘟疫狗的鼻子。

04:08.197 --> 04:09.680
What did he say?
他说什么？

04:09.749 --> 04:11.725
The colorful insults
are the best part of the game!
五彩缤纷的辱骂
是游戏中最好的部分！

04:11.749 --> 04:14.094
That figures. Hmm.
这数字。唔。

04:14.163 --> 04:17.094
So how do you win
this goofball game, anyway?
那么你如何获胜
无论如何，这个愚蠢的游戏？

04:17.163 --> 04:19.059
Since Bubble Bass challenged us,
自从 Bubble Bass 向我们发起挑战以来，

04:19.128 --> 04:21.646
all we have to do is get
close enough to tag him out.
我们所要做的就是得到
距离足够近，可以把他标记出来。

04:21.715 --> 04:22.991
We get three chances,
我们有3次机会，

04:23.059 --> 04:25.404
or should I say,
Three Challenges.
或者我应该说，
三大挑战。

04:25.473 --> 04:27.577
- Oh, hmm.
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，嗯。
- 哦，孩子！

04:27.646 --> 04:29.818
Look, Squidward!
[grunting]
看，章鱼哥！
[咕噜声]

04:29.887 --> 04:32.059
Oh, this feels stupid.
哦，这感觉很愚蠢。

04:32.128 --> 04:33.508
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:33.577 --> 04:35.128
both: Charge!
两人：冲锋！

04:35.197 --> 04:36.680
[yelling]
[大喊]

04:36.749 --> 04:39.335
[strains]
[菌株]

04:39.404 --> 04:41.025
Huh?
Uh-oh.
啊？
呃哦。

04:41.094 --> 04:42.818
What?
[both yell]
什么？
[两人大喊]

04:42.887 --> 04:45.197
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

04:45.266 --> 04:48.094
<i>[crowd cheering]</i>
<i>[人群欢呼]</i>

04:48.163 --> 04:51.128
Tag, you lose!
[both laughing]
标签，你输了！
[两人都笑了]

04:51.197 --> 04:53.646
[screams]
We decapitated him!
[尖叫声]
我们把他斩首了！

04:53.715 --> 04:55.301
Oh, calm down.
噢，冷静点。

04:55.370 --> 04:58.818
It's just a dummy made from
his mother's couch cushions
这只是一个假人
他母亲的沙发垫

04:58.887 --> 05:00.680
and a sleeping bag.
[sighs]
和一个睡袋。
[叹气]

05:00.749 --> 05:02.232
All of this for a tab?
所有这些都是为了一个标签？

05:02.301 --> 05:04.266
Oh!
哦！

05:04.335 --> 05:06.439
But you were magnificent, Squidward.
但你很棒，章鱼哥。

05:06.508 --> 05:08.853
So strong and courageous.
如此坚强和勇敢。

05:08.922 --> 05:10.301
As always.
一如既往。

05:10.370 --> 05:12.956
Thy canker sore bottoms
curdle seaweed
你的臀部溃疡
凝结海藻

05:13.025 --> 05:15.335
and sour the ocean.
并使海洋变酸。

05:15.404 --> 05:17.004
- Oh, you...
- I got this one, Squidward.
- 哦，你...
- 我拿到了这个，章鱼哥。

05:17.059 --> 05:20.715
Oh, yeah? Well, your pillows
are filed with urchins,
哦，是吗？嗯，你的枕头
与海胆一起归档，

05:20.784 --> 05:23.128
and your shirts are inside out!
而且你的衬衫反面了！

05:23.197 --> 05:25.887
Adding injury to insult.
侮辱上加伤害。

05:25.956 --> 05:29.301
<i>[trumpet fanfare]
- [groans]</i>
<i>[喇叭声]
- [呻吟]</i>

05:29.370 --> 05:30.715
<i>[crowd cheering]</i>
<i>[人群欢呼]</i>

05:30.784 --> 05:33.197
Oh, look at all this junk.
哦，看看这些垃圾。

05:33.266 --> 05:35.232
[excitedly] I know.
Isn't it great?
[兴奋]我知道。
不是很好吗？

05:35.301 --> 05:36.991
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:37.059 --> 05:38.922
Let's finish this.
让我们完成这个吧。

05:38.991 --> 05:41.025
He's obviously in that bullpen.
他显然就在那个牛棚里。

05:41.094 --> 05:44.542
[huffing and growling]
[气喘吁吁]

05:44.611 --> 05:48.094
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

05:48.163 --> 05:49.887
[roars]
[怒吼]

05:51.887 --> 05:53.680
both: Bubble Bass' mom!
两人：泡泡巴斯的妈妈！

05:53.749 --> 05:57.232
You!
You chipped my furniture!
你！
你把我的家具弄碎了！

05:57.301 --> 06:00.059
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:00.128 --> 06:02.680
He tricked us.
What do we do?
他欺骗了我们。
我们该怎么办？

06:02.749 --> 06:04.853
Hide!
[both whimpering]
隐藏！
[两人都呜咽]

06:05.991 --> 06:08.094
And that's my good tablecloth!
这就是我的好桌布！

06:08.163 --> 06:10.163
<i>[tires squealing]</i>
<i>[轮胎吱吱声]</i>

06:10.232 --> 06:12.473
[all grunting and screaming]
[所有的咕哝声和尖叫声]

06:12.542 --> 06:15.439
<i>[quirky music]</i>
<i>[古怪的音乐]</i>

06:15.508 --> 06:22.404
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:24.818 --> 06:26.439
Ah.
啊。

06:26.508 --> 06:28.059
[both humming]
[两人都哼哼]

06:28.128 --> 06:31.266
<i>[tango music]</i>
<i>[探戈音乐]</i>

06:31.335 --> 06:38.232
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:38.301 --> 06:39.887
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:39.956 --> 06:41.508
Aww!
哇！

06:43.542 --> 06:45.577
[alarm buzzing]
[警报声响起]

06:45.646 --> 06:47.404
- Huh?
- [grunts]
- 啊？
- [咕哝]

06:47.473 --> 06:49.439
Sorry, sweetie.
Gotta run.
对不起，亲爱的。
得跑了。

06:49.508 --> 06:51.818
I'm late for the bake sale.
- [moans]
我参加烘焙义卖迟到了。
- [呻吟]

06:51.887 --> 06:53.749
Call me!
打电话给我！

06:53.818 --> 06:55.301
[gulps]
[吞咽]

06:55.370 --> 06:57.577
Mother!
母亲！

06:57.646 --> 07:00.508
[screaming]
Why?
[尖叫]
为什么？

07:00.577 --> 07:02.577
[ground rumbling]
[地面隆隆声]

07:02.646 --> 07:03.956
Whoa!
哇！

07:05.197 --> 07:08.646
<i>[crowd cheering,
trumpet fanfare]</i>
<i>[人群欢呼，
小号号角]</i>

07:10.473 --> 07:12.094
[strains]
[菌株]

07:15.266 --> 07:17.577
Sir Squidward,
you look magnificent
章鱼哥先生，
你看起来棒极了

07:17.646 --> 07:19.473
upon your mighty steed.
骑在你强大的战马上。

07:19.542 --> 07:20.991
[gasps]
Yes.
[喘气]
是的。

07:21.059 --> 07:23.784
Yes, I see it now!
是的，我现在看到了！

07:23.853 --> 07:25.163
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:25.232 --> 07:28.508
Any last words, Squid-wuss?
最后还有什么话要说吗，鱿鱼乌斯？

07:28.577 --> 07:30.508
May thy fat head
愿你的胖头

07:30.577 --> 07:35.128
be set upon by sea spiders
and torn asunder,
被海蜘蛛袭击
并被撕裂，

07:35.197 --> 07:39.784
leaving only thine eyes
to witness the humiliation!
只留下你的眼睛
见证屈辱！

07:39.853 --> 07:42.611
Ooh, pretty good last words.
呵呵，最后一句话说得好。

07:42.680 --> 07:44.715
Sir Squidward, thy shield.
章鱼哥先生，你的盾牌。

07:44.784 --> 07:47.818
Ha!
Shield, shmield.
哈!
盾牌，施米尔德。

07:47.887 --> 07:50.301
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:50.370 --> 07:51.956
My hero.
我的英雄。

07:52.025 --> 07:54.887
<i>[crowd cheering]</i>
<i>[人群欢呼]</i>

07:54.956 --> 07:57.991
[both growl]
[双方咆哮]

07:58.059 --> 08:01.163
[inhales]
[horn blaring]
[吸气]
[喇叭声]

08:01.232 --> 08:02.508
Ah!
啊!

08:02.577 --> 08:04.266
Ya!
呀！

08:04.335 --> 08:06.542
- Ya!
- Ah, ha-ha!
- 是啊！
- 啊，哈哈！

08:06.611 --> 08:08.197
[roars]
[怒吼]

08:08.266 --> 08:11.370
Oh, I can't look.
哦，我看不下去。

08:11.439 --> 08:13.749
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:13.818 --> 08:15.611
Mommy!
妈妈！

08:15.680 --> 08:17.646
[growling]
[咆哮]

08:17.715 --> 08:19.991
[slowed groaning]
[缓慢的呻吟]

08:28.059 --> 08:31.577
All right, Bubble Bass.
You're tagged.
好吧，泡泡巴斯。
你被标记了。

08:31.646 --> 08:32.922
Pay your tab.
支付你的账单。

08:32.991 --> 08:34.577
[mocking grunts]
[嘲笑的咕哝声]

08:34.646 --> 08:38.059
You bested me
at Three Deadly Challenges.
你打败了我
在三个致命的挑战中。

08:38.128 --> 08:40.128
But I am broke!
但我破产了！

08:40.197 --> 08:43.956
Verily, I spent all of my money
on cardboard.
确实，我的钱都花光了
在纸板上。

08:46.335 --> 08:48.025
What are you going to do to me?
你要对我做什么？

08:48.094 --> 08:51.542
Nothing,
but I am sure Mr. Krabs
没什么，
但我确信蟹老板

08:51.611 --> 08:55.956
has some Deadly Challenges
of his own for you.
有一些致命的挑战
他自己的给你的。

08:57.301 --> 08:59.611
<i>[labored breathing]</i>
<i>[呼吸困难]</i>

08:59.680 --> 09:01.680
This is torture!
这就是折磨！

09:01.749 --> 09:03.922
My arms are killing me.
我的手臂快要死了。

09:03.991 --> 09:06.335
I can't feel my fingers.
我感觉不到我的手指了。

09:06.404 --> 09:09.542
I feel a cramp!
I'm cramped!
我感觉抽筋！
我很局促！

09:09.611 --> 09:10.991
My back is breaking.
我的背快断了。

09:12.473 --> 09:15.715
[wailing]
[哀号]

09:15.784 --> 09:17.439
[moans]
[呻吟声]

09:17.508 --> 09:19.577
[overlapping complaints]
- That guy is terrible!
[重叠投诉]
——那个家伙太可怕了！

09:19.646 --> 09:22.301
Look, I sympathize.
瞧，我深表同情。

09:22.370 --> 09:25.577
He's gotta work here
until he pays off his tab.
他必须在这里工作
直到他还清账单。

09:25.646 --> 09:28.577
- I've got some money.
- I'll contribute to that.
- 我有一些钱。
- 我会为此做出贡献。

09:28.646 --> 09:32.059
What? That's not...
I didn't really... oh... oh.
什么？那不是...
我真的没有……哦……哦。

09:32.128 --> 09:34.784
[gasps]
[overlapping complaints]
[喘气]
[重叠投诉]

09:34.853 --> 09:37.094
Just get that menace
out of here!
只是受到那个威胁
离开这里！

09:37.163 --> 09:39.232
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

09:39.301 --> 09:42.611
[grumbling]
Hmm?
[抱怨]
嗯？

09:42.680 --> 09:45.956
All right, Bubble Bass.
Your tab's been wiped clean.
好吧，泡泡巴斯。
你的标签已经被擦干净了。

09:46.025 --> 09:47.646
You can go.
你可以走了。

09:48.749 --> 09:51.266
Well?
Go already!
出色地？
已经走了！

09:51.335 --> 09:53.991
Verily, I am free-ith.
确实，我是自由的。

09:56.025 --> 09:58.542
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

09:58.611 --> 10:00.508
<i>[cash register dings]
Huh?</i>
<i>[收银机叮叮声]
嗯？</i>

10:02.059 --> 10:04.025
[laughs]
[笑]

10:04.094 --> 10:06.542
[whinnies]
Krabs!
[嘶嘶声]
螃蟹们！

10:06.611 --> 10:09.370
I thank thee,
clapper-clawed barnacle,
我感谢你，
拍手藤壶，

10:09.439 --> 10:13.266
for forgiving my debt, and FYI,
免除我的债务，仅供参考，

10:13.335 --> 10:16.991
I just opened up a new tab.
我刚刚打开了一个新标签。

10:17.059 --> 10:19.887
[squeals, cackles]
[尖叫声，咯咯笑声]

10:19.956 --> 10:21.611
Hi-ya!
- [growls]
嗨呀！
- [咆哮]

10:21.680 --> 10:25.059
Oh, Bubble Bass!
哦，泡泡鲈鱼！

10:25.128 --> 10:27.853
[laughs]
[笑]

10:27.922 --> 10:30.646
Olé, Señor Squidward?
奥莱，章鱼哥先生？

10:30.715 --> 10:32.749
Olé, SpongeBob.
奥莱，海绵宝宝。

10:34.128 --> 10:36.922
[both humming]
[两人都哼哼]

10:36.991 --> 10:38.266
I'll lead.
我来领导。

10:38.335 --> 10:40.922
- May I?
- Hmm?
- 我可以？
- 唔？

10:40.991 --> 10:43.646
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

10:43.715 --> 10:45.646
Eh, but, of course.
呃，但是，当然。

10:47.577 --> 10:50.473
[both humming]
[两人都哼哼]

[两人都哼哼]